{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/b65921066dbb69a8b484ba28894ec519.poster.avif?t=1761158900\" width=509 height=413 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/b65921066dbb69a8b484ba28894ec519.webm?t=1761158900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Bestest Knight</strong> is an incremental autobattler RPG packed with unlockable content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin as a young, inexperienced stable boy with a dream \u2014 and rise beyond every expectation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on an adventure, earn gold and experience, discover new recipes, treasures, and dungeons, and invest in your character.<br>As your knight-rank grows, so do your possibilities \u2014 unlocking new mechanics, upgradeable gear, and new areas in your hometown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades, people\u2026 UPGRADES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost everything is upgradeable: weapons, armor, launchers (to kickstart your adventures), potions, attributes, horses\u2026 you name it!<br>Each upgrade doesn\u2019t just improve stats \u2014 it also grants new abilities and a <strong>brand-new look</strong> at max level.<br>You can also craft new items, but first, you need the right recipe \u2014 found either during your adventures or in dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/2136b827220471907e47e08791b25bc8.poster.avif?t=1761158900\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/2136b827220471907e47e08791b25bc8.webm?t=1761158900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/2136b827220471907e47e08791b25bc8.mp4?t=1761158900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Home Town</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before heading out, explore your hub area. Greet your not-so-friendly neighbors, prepare for your journey, and discover new ways to strengthen your knight.<br>At first, the townspeople won\u2019t trust you. Prove yourself, and they may offer helpful tools, tips, and upgrades. Keep your eyes open!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/821c237c8936c3d1f7f52a8bcaf05190.poster.avif?t=1761158900\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/821c237c8936c3d1f7f52a8bcaf05190.webm?t=1761158900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/821c237c8936c3d1f7f52a8bcaf05190.mp4?t=1761158900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overworld Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step through the big iron gate and a new adventure begins\u2026 filled with treacherous traps, obstacles, monsters, and opportunities.<br>Watch your health and stamina \u2014 if either drops to zero, your adventure ends and you return to town with your earnings.<br>Each adventure brings you closer to glory and makes you stronger. With luck, you might even find treasures or new recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/1faccc50d46f36ac7f9e49202010db6f.poster.avif?t=1761158900\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/1faccc50d46f36ac7f9e49202010db6f.webm?t=1761158900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treasures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your journeys, you\u2019ll find treasure items that grant permanent stat boosts and unique abilities (max 3 equipped).<br>Some treasures even change game mechanics in interesting ways, opening up new strategies. Experiment to your heart\u2019s content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/81ba025a636e7101e7085bb9ef5ef6fe.avif?t=1761158900\" width=1560 height=545 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dungeons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At key points in your journey, you\u2019ll discover dungeons \u2014 short, optional mini-adventures with tougher enemies, dungeon-specific recipes, treasures, and powerful bosses.<br>Defeating bosses grants passive abilities, so explore them fully.<br>Discovered dungeons can be accessed anytime via the teleporter in your hometown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/6b7e4418c0ac541744ddf8d06a0be004.poster.avif?t=1761158900\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/6b7e4418c0ac541744ddf8d06a0be004.webm?t=1761158900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/6b7e4418c0ac541744ddf8d06a0be004.mp4?t=1761158900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://stor