ributes, horses\u2026 you name it!<br>Each upgrade doesn\u2019t just improve stats \u2014 it also grants new abilities and a <strong>brand-new look</strong> at max level.<br>You can also craft new items, but first, you need the right recipe \u2014 found either during your adventures or in dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/2136b827220471907e47e08791b25bc8.poster.avif?t=1761158900\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/2136b827220471907e47e08791b25bc8.webm?t=1761158900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/2136b827220471907e47e08791b25bc8.mp4?t=1761158900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Home Town</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before heading out, explore your hub area. Greet your not-so-friendly neighbors, prepare for your journey, and discover new ways to strengthen your knight.<br>At first, the townspeople won\u2019t trust you. Prove yourself, and they may offer helpful tools, tips, and upgrades. Keep your eyes open!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/821c237c8936c3d1f7f52a8bcaf05190.poster.avif?t=1761158900\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/821c237c8936c3d1f7f52a8bcaf05190.webm?t=1761158900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076460/extras/821c237c8936c3d1f7f52a8bcaf05190.mp4?t=1761158900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_